
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#050914">
<meta name="description" content="ASTROVYN — An independent community exploring space science, emerging technology, research, engineering and innovation. Converting curiosity into innovations.">
<title>ASTROVYN | Beyond The Known</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #050914;
  --bg2: #080f1d;
  --panel: rgba(13,25,43,.78);
  --line: rgba(147,190,255,.15);
  --blue: #8bc8ff;
  --white: #f1f6ff;
  --muted: #96a7bd;
  --cyan: #55e4ff;
}

* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior:smooth; scroll-padding-top:85px; }
body {
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--white);
  font-family:Inter, sans-serif;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
button { font:inherit; }
::selection { background:#8bc8ff; color:#04101d; }
#stars {
  position:fixed; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%;
  z-index:-3; pointer-events:none;
}
.ambient {
  position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-2; pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 15%,rgba(30,87,151,.18),transparent 42%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 55%,rgba(17,83,120,.12),transparent 40%);
}
.noise {
  position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:10; pointer-events:none;
  opacity:.035;
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.9' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.5'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
}
.container { width:min(1160px,90%); margin:auto; }
section { padding:110px 0; position:relative; }
.section-tag {
  color:var(--blue); font-size:.73rem; letter-spacing:3px;
  text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:17px; font-weight:700;
}
.section-title {
  font:600 clamp(2rem,5vw,3.6rem)/1.12 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;
  letter-spacing:-1.5px; max-width:800px;
}
.section-desc {
  color:var(--muted); line-height:1.9; max-width:700px;
  margin-top:20px; font-size:.98rem;
}
.gradient-text {
  background:linear-gradient(100deg,#fff,#9dcfff 55%,#60d8ed);
  -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;
}
.btn {
  display:inline-flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center;
  gap:12px; padding:15px 22px; border-radius:6px;
  border:1px solid var(--line); cursor:pointer; transition:.3s;
  font-size:.88rem; font-weight:600;
}
.btn-primary { background:#dceeff; color:#06101d; border-color:#dceeff; }
.btn-primary:hover { background:#fff; transform:translateY(-3px); }
.btn-outline { background:rgba(255,255,255,.025); }
.btn-outline:hover { border-color:var(--blue); background:rgba(139,200,255,.08); }
header {
  position:fixed; top:0; width:100%; z-index:50;
  background:rgba(5,9,20,.75); backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  border-bottom:1px solid transparent; transition:.3s;
}
header.scrolled { border-bottom-color:var(--line); }
.nav {
  min-height:76px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center; gap:20px;
}
.brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:11px; }
.brand img { width:46px; height:36px; object-fit:contain; }
.brand-name { font:700 1.18rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; letter-spacing:4px; }
.nav-links { display:flex; gap:27px; align-items:center; }
.nav-links a {
  font-size:.78rem; color:#bdc9da; transition:.25s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color:white; }
.nav-cta { padding:11px 16px; font-size:.78rem; }
.menu-btn {
  display:none; color:white; border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:transparent; padding:10px 13px; border-radius:5px;
}
.hero {
  min-height:100svh; display:flex; align-items:center;
  padding-top:110px; padding-bottom:80px; overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;
  align-items:center; gap:45px;
}
.eyebrow {
  display:inline-flex; gap:10px; align-items:center;
  border:1px solid var(--line); padding:10px 14px;
  border-radius:50px; font-size:.72rem; color:#c4d7ef;
  letter-spacing:1.1px; margin-bottom:27px;
  background:rgba(12,25,43,.5);
}
.pulse {
  width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%;
  background:#6ee7bd; box-shadow:0 0 13px #6ee7bd;
  animation:pulse 2s infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse { 50% { opacity:.35; transform:scale(.7); } }
.hero h1 {
  font:600 clamp(3.4rem,8vw,6.7rem)/.99 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;
  letter-spacing:-5px;
}
.hero h1 span { display:block; }
.hero-sub {
  color:#a8b8cc; font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.9;
  max-width:560px; margin:28px 0 30px;
}
.hero-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:13px; }
.hero-meta {
  display:flex; gap:25px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:38px; color:#8397b1; font-size:.76rem;
}
.hero-meta span::before { content:"✦"; color:var(--blue); margin-right:9px; }
.hero-visual {
  min-height:480px; display:grid; place-items:center;
  position:relative; perspective:900px;
}
.orbit {
  position:absolute; border:1px solid rgba(125,188,255,.2);
  border-radius:50%; transform:rotate(-25deg);
  animation:orbitFloat 10s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.orbit.one { width:370px; height:170px; }
.orbit.two { width:450px; height:220px; transform:rotate(55deg); }
.orbit.three { width:490px; height:290px; transform:rotate(-65deg); opacity:.5; }
@keyframes orbitFloat { 50% { transform:rotate(-18deg) translateY(-9px); } }
.planet {
  width:205px; height:205px; border-radius:50%; position:relative;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 32% 25%,#b7dcff 0,#467bb1 13%,#153458 42%,#081324 70%);
  box-shadow:inset -30px -20px 45px #02050d,0 0 70px rgba(66,151,255,.22);
  animation:planetFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.planet::after {
  content:""; position:absolute; inset:12px; border-radius:50%;
  border:1px solid rgba(210,235,255,.09);
}
@keyframes planetFloat { 50% { transform:translateY(-14px) rotate(4deg); } }
.planet-ring {
  position:absolute; width:310px; height:85px;
  border:10px solid rgba(122,191,255,.48); border-left-color:transparent;
  border-right-color:rgba(167,216,255,.7); border-radius:50%;
  transform:rotate(-24deg); filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px #307bc7);
}
.float-label {
  position:absolute; border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:rgba(8,18,34,.86); backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  padding:13px 16px; border-radius:8px;
  font-size:.73rem; color:#c3d8f0; animation:labelFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.float-label b { display:block; font-size:.9rem; color:white; margin-bottom:5px; }
.label-a { top:55px; right:0; }
.label-b { bottom:65px; left:0; animation-delay:-2s; }
@keyframes labelFloat { 50% { transform:translateY(-10px); } }
.scroll-hint {
  position:absolute; bottom:25px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
  color:#7c90aa; font-size:.68rem; letter-spacing:2px;
}
.scroll-hint span { display:block; text-align:center; margin-top:9px; animation:down 1.5s infinite; }
@keyframes down { 50% { transform:translateY(6px); } }
.ticker { overflow:hidden; border-block:1px solid var(--line); background:rgba(9,18,32,.7); }
.ticker-track {
  display:flex; width:max-content; gap:38px; padding:22px 0;
  animation:marquee 35s linear infinite;
}
.ticker-track span { color:#a6bad4; font-size:.77rem; letter-spacing:2px; white-space:nowrap; }
.ticker-track span::after { content:"✦"; margin-left:38px; color:var(--blue); }
@keyframes marquee { to { transform:translateX(-50%); } }
.about-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:start; }
.about-copy p { color:var(--muted); line-height:2; margin-top:18px; }
.feature-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; }
.feature {
  padding:25px 20px; border:1px solid var(--line);
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(18,35,57,.7),rgba(8,16,29,.5));
  border-radius:9px; transition:.35s;
}
.feature:hover { transform:translateY(-6px); border-color:rgba(139,200,255,.5); }
.feature-icon { font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:20px; }
.feature h3 { font:600 1.02rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; margin-bottom:10px; }
.feature p { color:var(--muted); font-size:.83rem; line-height:1.8; }
.metrics {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
  margin-top:60px; background:rgba(11,23,40,.6);
}
.metric { padding:30px 20px; text-align:center; }
.metric + .metric { border-left:1px solid var(--line); }
.metric strong { display:block; font:600 1.8rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; color:#d7ebff; }
.metric span { color:var(--muted); font-size:.75rem; margin-top:8px; display:block; }
.alt-section { background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(12,25,43,.38),transparent); }
.card-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:45px; }
.info-card {
  position:relative; padding:30px; border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px; background:var(--panel); overflow:hidden;
  transition:transform .35s,border-color .35s;
}
.info-card::before {
  content:""; position:absolute; width:180px; height:180px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(68,144,227,.12),transparent 70%);
  top:-90px; right:-90px; transition:.4s;
}
.info-card:hover { transform:translateY(-7px); border-color:rgba(139,200,255,.42); }
.info-card:hover::before { transform:scale(1.6); }
.card-num { color:var(--blue); font:600 .8rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; letter-spacing:2px; }
.info-card h3 { font:600 1.25rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; margin:25px 0 14px; }
.info-card p { font-size:.86rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.9; }
.card-link { display:inline-block; margin-top:22px; color:#b9dfff; font-size:.8rem; }
.card-link:hover { color:white; }
.pill-row { display:flex; gap:9px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:22px; }
.pill { border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:30px; padding:7px 11px; font-size:.69rem; color:#afc1d8; }
.project-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:18px; margin-top:45px; }
.project {
  padding:0; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px; background:rgba(10,21,37,.8); transition:.3s;
}
.project:hover { border-color:rgba(139,200,255,.5); transform:translateY(-4px); }
.project-art {
  min-height:180px; display:grid; place-items:center; overflow:hidden;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(41,108,174,.28),transparent 70%),#091323;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); position:relative;
}
.project-art .symbol { font-size:4rem; filter:drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(107,180,255,.5)); transition:.5s; }
.project:hover .symbol { transform:scale(1.18) rotate(5deg); }
.project-body { padding:27px; }
.project-body small { color:var(--blue); letter-spacing:2px; font-size:.67rem; }
.project-body h3 { font:600 1.3rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; margin:12px 0; }
.project-body p { color:var(--muted); font-size:.85rem; line-height:1.9; }
.notice {
  padding:18px 20px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:7px;
  color:#9eafc4; font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.8; margin-top:22px;
}
.process { margin-top:45px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:15px; }
.step { border-top:1px solid rgba(139,200,255,.5); padding:24px 5px 0; }
.step-number { color:var(--blue); font:600 1.5rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; }
.step h3 { margin:18px 0 10px; font-size:1rem; }
.step p { color:var(--muted); font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.85; }
.values-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:15px; margin-top:40px; }
.value { padding:24px; background:rgba(14,27,46,.55); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; }
.value h3 { margin-bottom:11px; font:600 1.05rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; }
.value p { font-size:.83rem; line-height:1.85; color:var(--muted); }
.founder-wrap {
  border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:13px; overflow:hidden;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;
  background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(15,34,57,.8),rgba(7,15,27,.85));
  margin-top:42px;
}
.founder-art {
  display:grid; place-items:center; min-height:310px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(74,145,217,.2),transparent 65%);
  border-right:1px solid var(--line);
}
.founder-art img { width:75%; max-width:300px; object-fit:contain; filter:drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(65,140,220,.15)); }
.founder-info { padding:45px; align-self:center; }
.founder-info .role { color:var(--blue); font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase; }
.founder-info h3 { font:600 clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem) "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; margin:15px 0; }
.founder-info p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.95; font-size:.9rem; }
.faq-list { margin-top:40px; max-width:850px; }
details { border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding:22px 0; }
summary { cursor:pointer; list-style:none; font-weight:600; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:15px; }
summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
summary::after { content:"+"; color:var(--blue); font-size:1.3rem; }
details[open] summary::after { content:"−"; }
details p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.9; font-size:.87rem; padding-top:16px; }
.contact-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr; gap:50px; margin-top:42px; }
.contact-copy p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.9; margin:18px 0 28px; }
.contact-list { display:grid; gap:12px; }
.contact-item {
  border:1px solid var(--line); padding:16px; border-radius:7px;
  background:rgba(12,24,41,.5); overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}
.contact-item small { color:var(--muted); display:block; margin-bottom:7px; font-size:.7rem; }
.contact-item a { color:#dcecff; font-size:.88rem; }
.contact-form {
  padding:28px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(12,24,41,.65);
}
.field { margin-bottom:18px; }
.field label { display:block; font-size:.78rem; margin-bottom:9px; color:#c1d1e4; }
.field input,.field textarea,.field select {
  width:100%; padding:14px; color:white; background:#07101e;
  border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:5px; outline:none;
  font:inherit; font-size:.85rem; transition:.2s;
}
.field input:focus,.field textarea:focus,.field select:focus { border-color:var(--blue); }
.field textarea { resize:vertical; min-height:125px; }
.field select option { background:#07101e; }
.form-note { font-size:.72rem; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; margin-top:14px; }
footer { border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:35px 0; }
.footer-top { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:25px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.footer-brand { font:700 1.2rem "Space Grotesk",sans-serif; letter-spacing:4px; }
.footer-tag { color:var(--muted); font-size:.78rem; margin-top:8px; }
.footer-links { display:flex; gap:18px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.footer-links a { color:#9aacc3; font-size:.77rem; }
.footer-links a:hover { color:white; }
.footer-bottom {
  border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:20px; margin-top:28px;
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  font-size:.7rem; color:#7488a1;
}
#topBtn {
  position:fixed; bottom:22px; right:22px; z-index:40;
  width:43px; height:43px; border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:6px; color:white; background:rgba(9,20,35,.9);
  cursor:pointer; opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:.3s;
}
#topBtn.show { opacity:1; pointer-events:auto; }
.reveal { opacity:0; transform:translateY(25px); transition:opacity .8s,transform .8s; }
.reveal.visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
  *,*::before,*::after { animation-duration:.01ms!important; animation-iteration-count:1!important; scroll-behavior:auto!important; transition-duration:.01ms!important; }
}
@media(max-width:900px) {
  .nav-links {
    display:none; position:absolute; top:76px; left:0; right:0;
    padding:25px 5%; background:rgba(5,9,20,.98);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:0;
  }
  .nav-links.open { display:flex; }
  .nav-links a { padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
  .nav-cta { display:none; }
  .menu-btn { display:block; }
  .hero-grid,.about-grid,.contact-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .hero-visual { min-height:390px; }
  .hero-copy { text-align:center; }
  .hero-sub { margin-inline:auto; }
  .hero-actions,.hero-meta { justify-content:center; }
  .hero h1 { letter-spacing:-3px; }
  .card-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  .process { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); row-gap:35px; }
  .contact-grid { gap:30px; }
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
  section { padding:78px 0; }
  .container { width:90%; }
  .brand-name { font-size:1rem; letter-spacing:3px; }
  .brand img { width:38px; }
  .hero { padding-top:120px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size:clamp(3rem,15vw,4.5rem); }
  .hero-sub { font-size:.95rem; }
  .hero-visual { min-height:330px; transform:scale(.85); margin:-15px 0; }
  .orbit.one { width:300px; height:140px; }
  .orbit.two { width:350px; height:170px; }
  .orbit.three { width:370px; height:220px; }
  .planet { width:160px; height:160px; }
  .planet-ring { width:245px; height:70px; }
  .label-a { right:-10px; }
  .label-b { left:-10px; }
  .card-grid,.project-grid,.values-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .feature-grid { gap:10px; }
  .feature { padding:19px 14px; }
  .metrics { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
  .metric { padding:23px 10px; }
  .metric:nth-child(3) { border-left:0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .metric:nth-child(4) { border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .metric:nth-child(2) { border-top:0; }
  .process { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  .founder-wrap { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .founder-art { min-height:220px; border-right:0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .founder-art img { max-width:220px; }
  .founder-info { padding:28px; }
  .contact-form { padding:20px; }
  .footer-top { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; }
  .footer-bottom { flex-direction:column; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<canvas id="stars"></canvas>
<div class="ambient"></div>
<div class="noise"></div>

<header id="header">
  <div class="container nav">
    <a href="#home" class="brand" aria-label="ASTROVYN home">
      <img src="astrovyn-logo.png" alt="ASTROVYN logo">
      <span class="brand-name">ASTROVYN</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#domains">Research Domains</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#approach">Our Approach</a>
      <a href="#founder">Founder</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="btn btn-outline nav-cta" href="#contact">Get In Touch ↗</a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> INDEPENDENT RESEARCH & INNOVATION COMMUNITY</div>
      <h1><span>Beyond</span><span class="gradient-text">The Known.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        A community built around curiosity, scientific thinking and ambitious ideas.
        We explore space science, emerging technologies and the possibilities that
        begin when questions turn into experiments.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#about" class="btn btn-primary">Explore ASTROVYN <span>↗</span></a>
        <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-outline">Discover Our Work ↓</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <span>Curiosity Driven</span>
        <span>Research Focused</span>
        <span>Future Oriented</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Animated planetary illustration">
      <div class="orbit one"></div>
      <div class="orbit two"></div>
      <div class="orbit three"></div>
      <div class="planet"></div>
      <div class="planet-ring"></div>
      <div class="float-label label-a"><b>01 / EXPLORE</b>Question the universe</div>
      <div class="float-label label-b"><b>02 / INNOVATE</b>Build beyond boundaries</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">SCROLL TO EXPLORE <span>↓</span></div>
</section>

<div class="ticker">
  <div class="ticker-track">
    <span>SPACE SCIENCE</span><span>EMERGING TECHNOLOGY</span><span>RESEARCH</span><span>ENGINEERING</span><span>ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</span><span>INNOVATION</span>
