        <h2 class="section-title">Curiosity is where <span class="gradient-text">everything begins.</span></h2>
        <p class="section-desc">
          ASTROVYN is an independent, growing community focused on exploring
          scientific questions, studying emerging technologies and developing
          ideas into meaningful projects.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy reveal">
        <p>
          The universe is full of questions waiting to be explored. Technology
          is full of possibilities waiting to be understood. ASTROVYN brings
          these two perspectives together through learning, research, creativity
          and experimentation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our approach is simple: start with a question, understand the science,
          examine existing knowledge, develop a concept and work towards a
          practical outcome. Not every idea becomes a breakthrough, but every
          serious investigation can build knowledge and experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          We aim to document our journey, share what we learn and gradually
          create a space where curious minds can exchange ideas and contribute
          to projects across science and technology.
        </p>
