<section id="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag reveal">05 — HOW WE WORK</div>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">From a question to a <span class="gradient-text">clearer understanding.</span></h2>
    <p class="section-desc reveal">
      Meaningful work requires more than an interesting idea. A repeatable
      process helps us examine evidence, make thoughtful decisions and improve
      our understanding over time.
    </p>
    <div class="process">
      <article class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <h3>Ask</h3>
        <p>Identify a specific question, define the problem and clarify what we need to understand.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <h3>Investigate</h3>
        <p>Study reliable sources, review existing research and understand the relevant scientific principles.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <h3>Develop</h3>
        <p>Build a concept, diagram, model, simulation or appropriate experiment based on what we have learned.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">04</div>
        <h3>Document</h3>
        <p>Record the method, findings, limitations and next questions so others can understand the process.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt-section" id="principles">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-tag reveal">06 — WHAT GUIDES US</div>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">Built on principles, <span class="gradient-text">not just possibilities.</span></h2>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <article class="value reveal"><h3>Scientific Integrity</h3><p>Distinguish established evidence, reasonable hypotheses and speculation. Never present an untested idea as a proven discovery.</p></article>
      <article class="value reveal"><h3>Continuous Learning</h3><p>Keep developing our knowledge, welcome constructive feedback and recognise that expertise grows through consistent effort.</p></article>
      <article class="value reveal"><h3>Responsible Innovation</h3><p>Consider safety, reliability, ethical questions and the real-world implications of technological ideas.</p></article>
      <article class="value reveal"><h3>Creative Thinking</h3><p>Explore multiple approaches, challenge assumptions respectfully and look for new ways to frame difficult questions.</p></article>
      <article class="value reveal"><h3>Clear Documentation</h3><p>Explain methods and outcomes honestly, including uncertainties, mistakes and limitations that others should know.</p></article>
      <article class="value reveal"><h3>Shared Progress</h3><p>Encourage people to exchange knowledge, learn together and help turn individual curiosity into collective progress.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

